<title>UK: Air France appoint new UK cargo manager.</title>
<headline>Air France appoint new UK cargo manager.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air France said in a statement it has appointed Anne Veyssie as cargo general manager Great Britain &amp; Ireland, effective September 16.</p>
<p>Veyssie, who will succeed Bernard Frattini, was recently part of the management team in charge of the Freight Programme at Air France head office.</p>
<p>Previously she held positions of space control manager at Paris Charle de Gualle airport and cargo sales representative at Orly airport.</p>
<p>- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
